  "strings": [
    "In the Third Age, war came again to Middle-earth\u0000",
    "as the will of Sauron searched anew for his Ring.\u0000",
    "The Dark Lord compelled many into his service\u0000",
    "including Saruman, a once great and wise wizard.\u0000",
    "Thus war came to Rohan...\u0000",
    "forcing King Théoden to seek refuge in the fortress of Helm's Deep.\u0000",
    "And now a vast army shall assault these ancient walls\u0000",
    "with siege ladders and war machines.\u0000",
    "To survive...\u0000",
    "the defenders must hold the Deeping Wall and the gate to the keep.\u0000",
    "But all must beware the devilry of Saruman's devices.\u0000"
  ]
